OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 2 JAN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including Mahler's
OL,8,     G'Resurrection' Symphony from
OL,9,     GVienna plus a celebration of
OL,10,     GRadio 3's New Generation Artists.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Icons of
OL,12,     FBritish Light Music
OL,13,     GDonald Macleod explores the
OL,14,     Gcomposers who fought to keep
OL,15,     Glight music alive in the wake of
OL,16,     Gdramatic shifts in the social
OL,17,     Glives of people in Britain.
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GJames Murphy and Katie Derham
OL,20,     Glook ahead to key cultural
OL,21,     Ghighlights in 2026.
