OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 2 JAN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,     GIncluding music by Tchaikovsky,
OL,8,     GWilliam Grant Still and Randall
OL,9,     GThompson.
OL,10,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,11,     GThe BBC Concert Orchestra and
OL,12,     Gconductor Daniel Parkinson invite
OL,13,     Gyou to dance the night away with
OL,14,     Gsinger Madeleine Morgan, and
OL,15,     Ghosts Craig Revel Horwood and
OL,16,     GKatie Derham.
OL,17,G2115FThe Lebrecht Interview
OL,18,     GNorman Lebrecht talks to tenor
OL,19,     GJonas Kaufmann about his life in
OL,20,     Gmusic, from going against his
OL,21,     Gfather's wishes in his early
OL,22,     Gcareer, to his love for languages.
